@startuml subscribeMessages
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
subscribeMessages – Subscribe to Kafka Topics
end title

participant "Requestor" as requestor
participant "p1KafkaConsumer" as subscribe #LightCyan
participant "Kafka" as kafka #LightYellow

requestor -> subscribe: subscribeMessages(topics, routingFunction)
activate subscribe

subscribe -> kafka: {subscribe(topics)}
activate kafka

kafka --> subscribe: subscription acknowledged
deactivate kafka

note over subscribe
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Store topic list  
  - Subscribe to provided topics  
  - Start listening to messages  
  - Route messages to handler  
end note

subscribe --> requestor: void
deactivate subscribe

@enduml